{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Believing that everyone hated him and that his life was already ruined, the protagonist one day comes across a suspicious document titled <i>&quot;How to Go to Another World&quot;</i>.<br>Thinking it was fake, he decided to try it using an elevator\u2014only to <strong>really arrive in another world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring what seems to be a strange underground facility, he stumbles upon a videotape containing a message from an unknown person.<br>Where is this place?<br>Who recorded the video, and what is happening here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo allows you to experience the first chapter (approximately 20-30 minutes of gameplay) and includes [parts of the game system/levels/story]. The full version will include the rest of the story and additional levels.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943980?t=1760167028","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943980/f0ed9a9dd30fff4b85e5386eb400239166d0afff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760167028","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943980/1db30d8812a62c0b01bbc96ee10ef85e9c8c3a60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760167028","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943980/1db30d8812a62c0b01bbc96ee10ef85e9c8c3a60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760167028","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains scenes that may be disturbing, including blood, corpses, and gore. Some scenes suggest or depict suicide. Sexual activity, sexual violence, or drug abuse are not included."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"